    assertGt(finalRouterBalance, 0, \"router should now hold user tokens\");\n\n        // Attacker has lost most of their balance; only a fraction was returned\n        // via the PartialDrainTarget, demonstrating user fund loss.\n        assertLt(finalAttackerBalance, initialAttackerBalance, \"attacker lost tokens to router\");\n\n        // The target may or may not hold tokens depending on receiver logic,\n        // but the key invariant is broken: router is now a token custodian.\n        assertEq(finalTargetBalance, 0, \"target does not retain tokens in this PoC\");\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n\n```",
